  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danieli ogosabera abanto baye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’eritang’ani bw’okogaamba gwa Dario, mosinto bw’Ahaswero bw’ororeria rw’Abamedi, oy’obegetwe akaba omorwoti kogaambera Abakalidayo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ee, ase omwaka bw’eritang’ani bw’okogaamba kwaye, inche Danieli nkamanya korwa ase Amariiko Amachenu igoro y’omobaro bw’emiaka eria ring’ana ri’Omonene riatebeetie Yeremia omobani, ng’a emiaka emerongo etano na ebere nigo yarenge gocha koera, Yerusalemu ogendererete koba rituuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkamorigereri’Omonene, nkamorigia n’ogosaba, na okoboria kw’oboitongo, na ase okweng’ata. Nkeboyia chigunia na kweaka ribu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkamosaba Omonene Nyasae one, nkaorokia ebibe biaito, ngateeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Aye Omonene, ore Nyasae omonene, naende ore bw’okoirokia, aye okorenda okobwatana kwao kw’ogotianania na goikerania obwanchani bwao botari koera ase baria bagwanchete na kobwata amachiiko ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Intwe twakorire ebibe na ayare amabe, twakorire obokaayayu na ogosaria; twaonchokire, twatigire amachiiko ao, na emeroberio yao echiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Titwaigwerete abasomba bao ababani, baria barenge gokwana ase erieta ria’o ase abarwoti baito, na abanene baito, ne chisokoro chiaito, na ase abanto bonsi b’ense eye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, nigo ogokora oboronge botambe, korende intwe botambe nigo tokwerentera obosooku buna iga reero, intwe abanto ba Yakobo, na abanto bamenyete Yerusalemu, na Abaisraeli bonsi, baria bare ang’e na abare aare ase chinse chionsi ase kwabaseretie gochia, ekiagera titwabete abegenwa ase ore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, obosooku nigo bore ase tore, na ase abarwoti baito, na ase abagaambi baito, na ase chisokoro chiaito, ekiagera twakorire ebibe ase ore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene Nyasae oito, nigo obwate amaabera, naende nigo ogotwabera, nonya twasaririe ase ore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Titwaigwerete eriogi ria’o aye Omonene Nyasae oito, ase okobwatia amachiiko ao, ayio gwatochiigete goetera ase abasomba bao ababani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bonsi basaririe amachiiko ao, baonchokire tibari koigwera eriogi ria’o. Ase ayio okoragererigwa okwo gwatianete koumora igoro yaito, okwo koriikire ase amachiiko a Musa, omosomba oo, aye Nyasae, gwatocheire, ekiagera intwe twakorire ebibe ase ore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaikeranirie amang’ana ao, ayio gwakwanete ase tore, na ase abagaambi baria barenge gotogaambera, ase ogotorentera amaakwa amanene. Inse y’erioba ayio akorekanire ase Yerusalemu tana gokorekana aande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koreng’ana buna ariikire ase amachiiko a Musa, amaakwa ayio onsi atocheire. Nonya nabo titwasabete Omonene Nyasae oito atororere amaabera; titwaonchogete korwa ase amabe aito na titwaigwerete ekeene kiao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aye Omonene nigo kwarenge n’oboronge bw’ogotorentera amaakwa ayio, ekiagera aye Omonene Nyasae oito, nigo ore omonyene oboronge ase ogokora kwao gwonsi, korende intwe titwaigwerete eriogi ria’o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na bono aye Omonene Nyasae oito, aye kwarusetie abanto bao korwa ase ense ya Misiri n’okoboko kwao kore nokobua, na kwemanyekanirie goika rituko ria reero. Intwe twakorire ebibe na ayare amabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, koreng’ana nogokora kwao gwonsi kw’oboronge koranche orusie endamwamu yao, na ekeririanda kiao, korwa ase Yerusalemu, omochie oo, ee, korwa ase egetunwa kiao egechenu. Ase engencho y’ebibe biaito, na ebie chisokoro chiaito, Yerusalemu amo n’abanto bao babeire bagokwanwa bobe, ase egati y’ abanto baria bonsi batoetanaine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bono, aye Nyasae oito, igwa ogosaba kwane inche omosomba oo, na ogosorora kwane, na ase engencho yao aye Omonene oraberie Obomenyo bwao Obochenu ase obosio bwao, Obomenyo obwo bore rituuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Nyasae one, tegerera oigwe, rigereria orore ogosirigwa gwaito, na omochie oyo okorokwa ase erieta ria’o. Intwe titori korenta ogosaba gwaito ase ore ng’a nabanyaboronge tore, korende nase engencho y’amaabera ao amaange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, igwa! Aye Omonene, abera! Aye Omonene, tegerera oigwe, na okore emeremo yao; ase engencho yao aye omonyene totebana! Aye Nyasae one, kora ayio, ekiagera omochie oo nigo okorokwa ase erieta ria’o, na abanto bao boigo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gabirieli okoorokia engencho y’obobani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agwo nkagenderera gokwana na gosaba, nkaorokia ebibe biane, na ebi’ abanto bane Abaisraeli na korenta ogosorora kwane ase obosio kw’Omonene Nyasae one, ase engencho y’egetunwa egechenu kia Nyasae one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero nagendererete gosaba, Gabirieli, omonto oria konya narorire ase okorora koria kw’eritang’ani, aganchichera bwango okoiruruka. Nigo yarenge engaki y’okoruegwa gw’ekeng’wanso kia mogoroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanyorokereria, aganteebia, “Aye Danieli, bono nigo nachire nkoe obong’aini na okomanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero gwachaagete ogosorora kwao, ring’ana rikaruegwa, na bono inche nachire gokoriteebia, ekiagera aye nigo bwanchire mono; ase ayio rengereria igoro ye ring’ana riria, na omanye engencho y’okorora koria”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chichuma emerongo etano na ebere” gose “isano na ibere” ara emerongo etano na ebere, emerongo etano na ebere nachio chiachiikirwe ase abanto bao, na ase omochie oo omochenu, gokoora ogosaria na gosiria ebibe, na gokora okobwatanigwa ase engencho y’obobe, naende korenta oboronge bwa kare na kare na kobeeka okorora koria na obobani boria ekemanyererio, boigo goaka Aase Aachenu Mono amaguta na koachena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, omanye na korengereria ng’a korwa engaki eria ring’ana riaruetwe igoro ya Yerusalemu ng’a noagachwe naende, goika ase engaki y’ogocha kw’oyomo Omoakwa Amaguta, oyore omogambi, nachibe chichuma isano na iberegose “isano na ibere” ara emerongo etano na ebere: isano na ibere. Naende ase chichuma emerongo etano nomo, na ibere, omochie noagachwe amo ne chinchera chiaye ne chiburi chiaye, korende ase engaki y’emechando emenene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ye chichuma “isano na ibere” ara emerongo etano na ebere: echio emerongo etano nomo, na ibere, Omoakwa Amaguta oria naitwe, tari ase engencho yaye ere omonyene. Abanto b’omogaambi orache mbasirie omochie oyo amo n’Obomenyo Obochenu. Omoerio oye noche buna chiooro, na goika omoerio esegi nebeo, ekiagera nigo ochiikeretwe ogosirigwa korwa kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nakore okobwatana ogokong’u kw’ogotianania nabaanto abange ase echuma eyemo; na ase egati‐gati y’echuma eyio nakoore ebing’wanso na okoruegwa gwonsi tibiruegwa naende. Oyokorenta obobe bw’okogechia nigo araache okoiruruka gosiria. Ayio nigo aragenderere goika egesusuro ki’ogosirigwa achiikeretwe korwa kare geikeranigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
